cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use quadro, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "quadro: knowledge-based 3D structure generation for G-quadruplexes"
abstract: >-
  quadro builds atomic models of G-quadruplexes from a topological description
  of the molecule — which residues form which tetrad, in what glycosidic
  orientation, stacked with what rise and twist. It assembles the structure
  residue by residue in torsion space using CYANA, then refines it in Cartesian
  space using Xplor-NIH under planarity, dihedral and hydrogen-bond restraints.
type: software
version: "14L"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mkdewe/quadro"

